{"id":218708,"bangumiId":218708,"type":2,"name":"宇宙よりも遠い場所","name_cn":"比宇宙更远的地方","date":"2018-01-02","year":"2018","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/16/de/218708_99YjL.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/16/de/218708_99YjL.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/16/de/218708_99YjL.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/16/de/218708_99YjL.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/16/de/218708_99YjL.jpg"},"summary":"无论何时，我们的第一步总是从好奇心开始。\r\n不曾看过的风景，不曾听过的声音，不曾闻过的味道，不曾摸过的质感，不曾尝过的食物，以及不曾感受过的澎湃。\r\n为了重拾不知何时忘却的记忆碎片和不知何时舍弃的感动的旅途。\r\n在到达终点的时候，我们会想些什么呢？\r\n40度的咆哮，50度的疯狂，60度的呐喊，跨越荒芜的海源到达原生地域。\r\n在地球的天边，远离文明的南方尽头。\r\n这是向南极（比宇宙更远的地方）进发的四位女孩子的旅行物语。我们通过她们回想起生于明日的光辉！","rating":{"rank":150,"total":16071,"count":{"1":40,"2":15,"3":27,"4":70,"5":196,"6":736,"7":2544,"8":6140,"9":4546,"10":1757},"score":8.2},"collection":{"on_hold":1348,"dropped":407,"wish":7491,"collect":23762,"doing":1990},"tags":[{"name":"原创","count":4218,"total_count":637364},{"name":"MADHouse","count":3496,"total_count":112601},{"name":"青春","count":3390,"total_count":110471},{"name":"2018年1月","count":2257,"total_count":31879},{"name":"花田十辉","count":2002,"total_count":21343},{"name":"TV","count":1943,"total_count":1447689},{"name":"治愈","count":1666,"total_count":309108},{"name":"南极","count":1588,"total_count":1591},{"name":"2018","count":1170,"total_count":79425},{"name":"百合","count":1164,"total_count":414701},{"name":"励志","count":997,"total_count":29316},{"name":"花泽香菜","count":831,"total_count":43616},{"name":"水濑祈","count":626,"total_count":1427},{"name":"早见沙织","count":560,"total_count":6706},{"name":"井口裕香","count":298,"total_count":2544},{"name":"日本","count":227,"total_count":315570},{"name":"石塚敦子","count":142,"total_count":539},{"name":"花田十輝","count":116,"total_count":3630},{"name":"日常","count":112,"total_count":416594},{"name":"轻百合","count":78,"total_count":39332},{"name":"催泪","count":72,"total_count":61541},{"name